Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:25.03,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}スローな暮らししていても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.66,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}踊ろうか眠ろうか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}焦っているばかり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:34.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}苦労に育てられたけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:39.20,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}今はいらない　いつかは咲きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:43.34,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}右往左往の毎日も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.66,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}これが routine life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.10,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}染みわたっていく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:28.00,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}开始慢节奏的生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.26,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}这是我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:33.26,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}渗透着方方面面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:50.23,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}睡前一杯热牛奶 什么都倒映不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:55.46,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}或许它挺香甜可口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:57.59,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}但这倒是其次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.88,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}该睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:04.64,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}感觉总也打不起精神来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:06.92,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}哦这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:11.39,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}原来不用那么累死累活也可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:15.45,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}那我应该可以放下心来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:19.20,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}我的人生真奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:25.03,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}过着慢节奏的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.66,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}可我还是着急抉择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.75,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}该开心跳舞还是睡个好觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:34.58,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}虽然曾有过一段艰苦的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:39.20,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}但现在已不再 我想有一天开花结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:43.34,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}四处奔波的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.66,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}也是我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.10,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}渗透着方方面面
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED1
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.36,0:22:43.39,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,捧げて　生きてる　意味わからないまま
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.93,0:22:49.40,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,もういいや　って　今日　なげだしてみよう
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.95,0:22:55.88,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,導き　いつもの　過ぎるだけの時間に
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.99,0:23:01.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,飽きてさ　ただ変わりたいだけだった
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.94,0:23:06.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,うつくしい　あなただけの世界　魅せて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.39,0:23:12.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}わたしのぜんぶを　届けたいよ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.47,0:23:19.62,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,祈りの欠片を　あつめて生きて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.93,0:23:29.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,美しくなんかなくていいよ　望んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.36,0:22:43.39,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,为别人奉献而生 却不知其意义
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.93,0:22:49.40,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但 就这样吧 今天 就暂且忘掉吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.95,0:22:55.88,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,遵从既定的引导 从而度过的时间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.99,0:23:01.87,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,我早就厌了 我只想将其彻底改变
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.94,0:23:06.87,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,你的世界 是那么美 让我着迷
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.39,0:23:12.87,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}我愿把我的一切 都献给你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.47,0:23:19.62,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,收集一片片破碎的祈祷 生活下去吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.93,0:23:29.35,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,不需要有多么美 期望就好
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED2
